WEBVTT

00:00:06.455 --> 00:00:09.424
Disgaea

00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:15.720
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:20.801
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:23.105 --> 00:00:28.509
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:33.742
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:42.288
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:42.391 --> 00:00:48.523
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:54.694
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:55.271 --> 00:01:01.403
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:01.543 --> 00:01:07.914
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:08.017 --> 00:01:11.248
Ah aishitageru,

00:01:11.453 --> 00:01:13.751
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:19.695 --> 00:01:22.391
Aishitageru.

00:01:31.507 --> 00:01:33.702
Fire Astro Particle
Cannon!

00:01:55.998 --> 00:01:58.865
Impossible, he shattered the
Astro Particle Cannon's beam!

00:02:05.007 --> 00:02:08.636
Now I'm going to teach you what happens
when you anger me, humans!

00:02:09.144 --> 00:02:12.079
Just a minute, Prince!
I'm coming, too!

00:02:17.619 --> 00:02:19.450
Wait for me, Jennifer!

00:02:19.555 --> 00:02:25.516
The Defender of Tomorrow is You!

00:02:26.628 --> 00:02:29.563
Wow, they're really going
at it out there.

00:02:29.665 --> 00:02:33.465
Jennifer, please tell me
everything that you know.

00:02:34.837 --> 00:02:40.571
The Earth Defense Force was originally founded
with the simple goal of saving humanity.

00:02:41.477 --> 00:02:45.470
As you all know, Earth is faced
with a terrible crisis!

00:02:46.148 --> 00:02:49.845
Explosive population growth!
Skyrocketing violent crime!

00:02:49.952 --> 00:02:53.854
The destruction of the environment!
Severe food shortages!

00:02:53.989 --> 00:02:56.981
If something is not done,
humanity will likely perish!

00:02:57.126 --> 00:03:00.289
Our mission is to save
the human race!

00:03:01.063 --> 00:03:05.523
We formulated a plan in which humanity
would migrate into space.

00:03:06.168 --> 00:03:07.226
But then...

00:03:08.504 --> 00:03:12.702
We don't need to go to all that trouble.
All we need to do is take over the Netherworld.

00:03:12.808 --> 00:03:14.366
What?!
The Netherworld?!

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:17.708
If we can invade the Netherworld
and exterminate the demons,

00:03:17.813 --> 00:03:19.474
...we'll be killing two birds
with one stone.

00:03:19.615 --> 00:03:21.105
Don't you agree?

00:03:22.584 --> 00:03:25.519
Wow, your old man is more demonic
than any demon I know.

00:03:26.121 --> 00:03:28.589
Why did your father suddenly
change plans?

00:03:29.191 --> 00:03:30.681
I honestly don't know.

00:03:31.226 --> 00:03:33.694
Celestia has to be involved
in this somehow...

00:03:35.063 --> 00:03:37.361
JENNIFER, THE COMMANDER
WISHES TO SEE YOU.

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:39.831
Jennifer...

00:03:40.869 --> 00:03:45.101
I'll make my father see that this isn't
the right way to save humanity.

00:03:48.911 --> 00:03:50.242
Jennifer!

00:04:04.126 --> 00:04:06.856
Those are the "you-know-whats"
that you talked about earlier!

00:04:06.962 --> 00:04:08.827
Don't thank me yet!
Let's get moving!

00:04:14.436 --> 00:04:17.894
Man, this ship is huge!
How much farther to the exit?

00:04:27.516 --> 00:04:28.676
Flonne?

00:04:32.821 --> 00:04:34.914
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:36.758 --> 00:04:38.692
Where do you think
you're going?

00:04:38.794 --> 00:04:40.762
Aw, that's not fair!

00:04:40.863 --> 00:04:42.626
Don't change
the subject.

00:04:43.198 --> 00:04:45.860
Anyway, I have to go up here
and see what's...

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:46.957
Hold it!

00:04:48.904 --> 00:04:51.498
Keep climbing!
That's it, nice and slow...

00:04:58.614 --> 00:05:00.241
I said freeze!
Take one step, and we'll open fire!

00:05:00.349 --> 00:05:02.214
Fine, fine, we're freezing!

00:05:02.317 --> 00:05:06.048
Please let me through! There's something
that I have to have to make sure of!

00:05:09.725 --> 00:05:11.283
I HAVE BROUGHT HER, SIR.

00:05:11.393 --> 00:05:12.690
Well done.

00:05:13.529 --> 00:05:15.827
Father, there is something that
I need to discuss with you.

00:05:15.931 --> 00:05:17.091
It can wait until later.

00:05:17.199 --> 00:05:20.600
For now, you should watch over how our forces
are comporting themselves in battle.

00:05:20.702 --> 00:05:23.967
After all, you will be the next Supreme
Commander of the Earth Defense Force.

00:05:27.142 --> 00:05:30.407
If this is what it means to be Supreme
Commander, I want no part of it.

00:05:30.679 --> 00:05:31.839
What was that?

00:05:31.947 --> 00:05:34.575
I'm saying that I don't want
to become like you, Father!

00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.077
Jennifer!

00:05:36.318 --> 00:05:40.914
It's wrong to think that we're justified in doing
anything so long as it saves humanity, Father!

00:05:42.491 --> 00:05:45.460
All right, I understand. There's no
need to get so emotional about it.

00:05:45.561 --> 00:05:47.153
You just want me to
hear you out, right?

00:05:50.232 --> 00:05:52.598
Let's talk
about this outside.

00:05:54.336 --> 00:05:58.466
Just as I thought, even a man like you
can be swayed by your daughter.

00:06:03.545 --> 00:06:07.606
I still have one last job for
Jennifer to carry out for me.

00:06:13.989 --> 00:06:15.149
Etna...

00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:20.288
Prinny Squad!
C'mon!

00:06:28.136 --> 00:06:29.797
What's with all
these penguins?!

00:06:31.206 --> 00:06:33.197
They aren't penguins,
they're Prinnies!

00:06:33.475 --> 00:06:36.603
I'm touched that they'd come
all this way for us!

00:06:40.916 --> 00:06:45.285
Listen up, you bums! We're gonna smash
this place 'til there's nothing left!

00:06:45.387 --> 00:06:46.979
Aye aye, dood!

00:06:47.522 --> 00:06:48.853
I knew it...

00:07:00.168 --> 00:07:04.298
Father... What happened
to me?

00:07:04.806 --> 00:07:08.469
You passed out all of a sudden.
You must be exhausted.

00:07:08.577 --> 00:07:10.738
You should rest
for a while.

00:07:15.817 --> 00:07:16.806
That's a...

00:07:16.918 --> 00:07:20.547
That's my daughter. You recognized
what this is right away.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.052
No, stop!

00:07:24.593 --> 00:07:26.026
Let me go!

00:07:26.862 --> 00:07:30.298
Please! Stop using me
as your pawn!

00:07:32.367 --> 00:07:34.267
Father!

00:07:37.773 --> 00:07:40.037
Angel Cannon power
at 120%.

00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:41.706
Ready to fire!

00:07:41.843 --> 00:07:43.936
Two bogies closing in
from dead ahead!

00:07:44.112 --> 00:07:47.445
So, you want another taste of
that beam, do you, demon?

00:07:50.152 --> 00:07:51.642
We're the Prinny Squad,
doods!

00:07:51.753 --> 00:07:53.311
Don't mind us, doods!

00:07:56.191 --> 00:07:58.125
"Prinny Squad"?

00:08:02.798 --> 00:08:05.130
That's the way! Destroy anything
you can get your flippers on!

00:08:05.233 --> 00:08:08.896
Destroy everything, eh?
Thursday, finish these things!

00:08:09.004 --> 00:08:12.201
ROGER! CHANGING
TO ROBO ATTACK.

00:08:22.984 --> 00:08:24.315
Where's Jennifer?

00:08:30.692 --> 00:08:31.351
Highness!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.519
Laharl!
Mr. Gordon!

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:36.163
I'm surprised
to see you.

00:08:36.565 --> 00:08:38.123
Where's Jennifer?!

00:08:38.533 --> 00:08:40.467
The Commander is busy modifying her
at the moment.

00:08:40.569 --> 00:08:41.900
Modifying her?!

00:08:42.204 --> 00:08:43.694
"Modifying"?

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:49.772
This I've gotta see!

00:08:49.945 --> 00:08:51.936
I'm kinda morbidly curious
about this myself...

00:08:57.853 --> 00:09:00.321
What do you mean, the Commander
is modifying Jennifer?!

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.252
Come now, it's hardly
unheard-of these days.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:07.328
Kurtis, your arm...

00:09:07.429 --> 00:09:09.397
And now he's revealed
that he's a cyborg!

00:09:09.498 --> 00:09:11.898
Flonne, you've got WAY
too many interests.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.059
In other words, she'll geek out
over anything.

00:09:14.169 --> 00:09:19.038
It happened in that incident five years ago.
I lost everything that day.

00:09:19.674 --> 00:09:21.869
Geez, they've started reminiscing
about the old days...

00:09:21.977 --> 00:09:24.002
Should we blindside him
while he's distracted?

00:09:24.112 --> 00:09:26.580
Shh! We have to
hear him out!

00:09:27.115 --> 00:09:31.211
A rival is always burdened with some
tragic incident in the past!

00:09:31.853 --> 00:09:34.481
It happened five years ago
this very day.

00:09:34.823 --> 00:09:38.054
A radical group opposed to
space research carried out...

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.254
...a bombing attack on the World
Space Research Institute today!

00:09:41.363 --> 00:09:43.888
The death toll has reached
350 so far, and...

00:09:50.305 --> 00:09:57.973
I lost my wife and daughter in that attack,
and 70% of my body was mechanized.

00:09:58.547 --> 00:10:03.246
I had no idea! Your family was among
the victims of that bombing?!

00:10:07.289 --> 00:10:10.622
What good is the Defender of Earth if he
can't save the lives of innocent people?

00:10:10.959 --> 00:10:16.488
A true Defender of Earth would stop at nothing
to save as many people as he could!

00:10:22.003 --> 00:10:23.732
You're wrong!

00:10:23.839 --> 00:10:27.468
Invading the Netherworld might
save humanity, I'll give you that.

00:10:27.843 --> 00:10:31.802
But doing so will cost countless lives!
Is that what you want?

00:10:32.113 --> 00:10:35.105
Do you really think that that's
what's best for humanity?

00:10:35.217 --> 00:10:38.618
It's naive thinking like that
that cost me my family!

00:10:42.824 --> 00:10:46.726
I swore an oath that day that if the
Defender of Earth couldn't do his job...

00:10:50.866 --> 00:10:54.859
...then I would defeat him and become
the TRUE Defender of Earth!

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:58.235
That is the only path
that's left to me now!

00:11:00.242 --> 00:11:01.573
You mustn't!

00:11:06.114 --> 00:11:10.073
You don't care if you create more innocent
victims like your wife and daughter?

00:11:10.285 --> 00:11:11.411
What?

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.788
Demons have families, too!

00:11:14.256 --> 00:11:17.714
It's wrong to think that anything is justified
if it might save humanity!

00:11:18.526 --> 00:11:23.088
Not when you should know the pain of losing
a loved one better than anyone!

00:11:24.599 --> 00:11:29.468
She's right! What would your wife and daughter
think of you up in heaven if they saw you now?

00:11:29.704 --> 00:11:31.604
Shut up!
SHUT UP!

00:11:35.277 --> 00:11:36.244
Kurtis!

00:11:38.613 --> 00:11:40.706
Dood, sabotage activities
have been completed!

00:11:40.815 --> 00:11:42.248
Kurtis!

00:11:45.954 --> 00:11:48.855
Don't come complaining to me when
Flonne gives you an earful...

00:11:48.957 --> 00:11:51.482
...for sneaking out in the middle
of that guy's speech, Highness.

00:11:51.927 --> 00:11:54.555
We don't have time to hang around
and listen to those two reminisce.

00:11:54.696 --> 00:11:57.164
The first order of business is to
take down that uppity bastard.

00:11:57.265 --> 00:11:58.254
Yessir...

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.627
Kurtis!

00:12:02.137 --> 00:12:04.037
Kurtis! Hurry!
This way!

00:12:09.878 --> 00:12:11.436
Forget about me...
Get going!

00:12:12.147 --> 00:12:13.409
But I can't...

00:12:13.682 --> 00:12:19.587
Jennifer is in #13 medical room.
If you go now, you might get there in time!

00:12:19.688 --> 00:12:20.655
Kurtis!

00:12:20.755 --> 00:12:22.746
Get going,
Defender of Earth!

00:12:25.894 --> 00:12:27.657
You should hurry, too.

00:12:27.796 --> 00:12:28.922
But...

00:12:29.564 --> 00:12:32.761
If you go, you might find the answers
that you're looking for.

00:12:33.068 --> 00:12:34.228
But I can't...

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.361
Hey, wait!
Put me down!

00:12:46.014 --> 00:12:47.982
Disgaea

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:54.989
Disgaea

00:13:01.296 --> 00:13:02.854
Give Jennifer
back to me!

00:13:02.964 --> 00:13:05.990
Very well, if you insist.
Jennifer!

00:13:07.535 --> 00:13:08.900
What in the world?!

00:13:13.575 --> 00:13:15.304
Come on, you call
THIS "modified"?

00:13:15.643 --> 00:13:18.612
All he did was stick some
weird doohickey on her head.

00:13:18.913 --> 00:13:21.541
I was expecting to see something
more amazing, too...

00:13:21.816 --> 00:13:24.910
You three don't seem to understand
just how amazing this device really is.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.351
Isn't that right,
Jennifer?

00:13:26.755 --> 00:13:28.552
Yes, Father.

00:13:29.124 --> 00:13:31.183
Is it just me, or she
acting kinda funny?

00:13:31.726 --> 00:13:33.523
It's mind control!

00:13:33.928 --> 00:13:35.691
Mind control?

00:13:36.064 --> 00:13:39.795
He's using that device to
control Jennifer's mind.

00:13:40.201 --> 00:13:42.795
Go, Jennifer!
Kill them!

00:13:42.904 --> 00:13:44.337
Yes, Father.

00:13:46.775 --> 00:13:49.209
As the sidekick of the
Defender of Earth, you must...

00:13:52.147 --> 00:13:54.308
Listen to what your heart
is telling you!

00:13:54.416 --> 00:13:57.214
What is right?!
What you ought to believe in?!

00:13:57.719 --> 00:14:00.415
And what you ought
to do right now!

00:14:00.789 --> 00:14:05.590
What she ought to do? YOU are the one
who doesn't understand, Gordon.

00:14:06.428 --> 00:14:09.625
To execute our Netherworld Invasion Project,
what we needed more than anything...

00:14:09.731 --> 00:14:12.461
...was for someone to scout ahead
and investigate the Netherworld.

00:14:13.034 --> 00:14:17.198
And you fulfilled that role beautifully.
Well done.

00:14:18.039 --> 00:14:20.906
Now, Jennifer, put him
out of his misery.

00:14:21.142 --> 00:14:23.110
Yes, Father.

00:14:26.948 --> 00:14:28.643
Oh, no!
Gordon's in trouble!

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.911
I swear, that bozo
can't do anything right!

00:14:31.019 --> 00:14:33.954
Don't interfere! This is something
that he has to do himself!

00:14:34.055 --> 00:14:35.852
What a sorry sight
this is, Gordon!

00:14:39.194 --> 00:14:42.561
What happened to that true spirit of a defender
that you showed me on the bridge?

00:14:42.664 --> 00:14:44.564
And now we're at the
climax of the battle!

00:14:44.666 --> 00:14:48.033
You traitor!
How dare you interfere?!

00:14:49.437 --> 00:14:50.563
Get down, everyone!

00:15:00.582 --> 00:15:01.776
Kurtis?!

00:15:10.625 --> 00:15:16.291
Gordon, I wanted to be a true
Defender of Earth, just like  you...

00:15:20.101 --> 00:15:22.069
Kurtis!

00:15:24.672 --> 00:15:25.866
Kurtis?

00:15:26.708 --> 00:15:30.872
Kurtis... You will be forever known
as the 38th Defender of Earth!

00:15:31.613 --> 00:15:34.343
Kurtis!
He's dead because of me!

00:15:36.484 --> 00:15:38.213
Hey, she's back
to normal!

00:15:38.319 --> 00:15:40.651
Shh! Don't talk during
a touching moment!

00:15:40.755 --> 00:15:44.282
You know, this almost makes it look like they're
the stars of the show all of a sudden.

00:15:44.392 --> 00:15:45.757
Are you okay
with that?

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.760
They can have the spotlight
this one time.

00:15:48.796 --> 00:15:51.356
It's always so sad when the rival
lays down his life, isn't it?

00:15:51.866 --> 00:15:54.300
Hey, where'd the old dude
with the mustache go?

00:15:58.373 --> 00:16:00.841
You don't know when to give
up, do you, Father?

00:16:02.477 --> 00:16:06.277
Stand aside, Jennifer!
Or have you forgotten who raised you?

00:16:07.315 --> 00:16:10.512
I always had faith in you.
I even loved you...

00:16:11.019 --> 00:16:15.012
But your only goal was to
use me for your own ends!

00:16:15.256 --> 00:16:17.121
You've lost the right to
be called father by me!

00:16:17.392 --> 00:16:19.553
Give yourself up,
Carter!

00:16:28.002 --> 00:16:30.300
Now this is what I call
divine protection!

00:16:32.674 --> 00:16:35.404
Why have the Celestial hosts
come to protect him?

00:16:40.615 --> 00:16:42.173
What in the world
is going on?!

00:16:42.283 --> 00:16:45.377
That clinches it, Celestia is definitely
working in cahoots with the human world.

00:16:45.954 --> 00:16:47.387
It can't be!

00:16:47.889 --> 00:16:49.857
Prepare to die, demons!

00:16:52.227 --> 00:16:54.627
Berry Barrier Balidaire!

00:17:03.905 --> 00:17:04.963
What have I done?

00:17:05.673 --> 00:17:08.403
You people must have a death wish
to dare to attack me!

00:17:19.387 --> 00:17:21.878
You have to believe me!
I'm innocent!

00:17:22.156 --> 00:17:25.216
I don't care how advanced human
science and technology is.

00:17:25.326 --> 00:17:27.487
You shouldn't have been able to come
in here as easily as you did...

00:17:27.595 --> 00:17:29.893
...without help from someone who's
familiar with the Netherworld.

00:17:30.265 --> 00:17:32.961
Answer me, human.
Who's pulling your strings?

00:17:33.134 --> 00:17:34.533
It's...

00:17:34.969 --> 00:17:35.697
Spill it!

00:17:35.803 --> 00:17:38.670
I-It's a man who
had white wings!

00:17:39.007 --> 00:17:40.804
White wings?

00:17:43.011 --> 00:17:44.273
I knew it, Celestia
is behind this.

00:17:44.946 --> 00:17:48.279
He told me that if Celestia and the human world
joined forces to wipe out the demons,

00:17:48.383 --> 00:17:51.079
...the safety of the human race
would be assured!

00:17:51.686 --> 00:17:54.416
Sounds like a big, fat lie
to me.

00:17:54.722 --> 00:17:56.485
I was only trying
to protect...

00:17:56.591 --> 00:17:59.253
Mr. Carter, there's something
that I want to ask you.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.691
Like what?

00:18:01.162 --> 00:18:02.186
Prinny!

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:03.892
Here you go...

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.704
Did you get this
from the same man?

00:18:10.805 --> 00:18:16.641
That's right. He said if we used its energy, it
would have a devastating effect on any demon.

00:18:17.145 --> 00:18:18.237
He did?

00:18:18.913 --> 00:18:21.780
It's no wonder that this knocked
you for a loop, Highness.

00:18:21.916 --> 00:18:24.111
This is the same kind of stone
as Flonne's necklace!

00:18:33.294 --> 00:18:35.194
How could I have
been so careless?!

00:18:41.135 --> 00:18:43.330
Sooner or later, the Netherworld
will be ours.

00:18:43.471 --> 00:18:44.733
What a fool
you are...

00:18:44.872 --> 00:18:46.169
W-Who's there?!

00:18:46.274 --> 00:18:48.936
You aren't capable of
saving the Earth.

00:18:49.644 --> 00:18:54.479
How can you expect to save anyone else when
you can't even save your own daughter?

00:18:57.952 --> 00:18:59.214
That ought to
do the trick!

00:19:03.391 --> 00:19:05.052
What did he mean
by that?

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:10.554
Was it that angel who said that?
Have I been betrayed?

00:19:16.037 --> 00:19:21.703
Surely fate's hand is at work here! Let's agree to
a noninterference treaty between our peoples!

00:19:22.076 --> 00:19:23.407
Very well.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.444
I'm glad we met you, everyone.
Take care.

00:19:28.616 --> 00:19:30.709
- GOODBYE. GOODBYE.
- Goodbye!

00:19:30.885 --> 00:19:33.649
Hey, why aren't you going home
in this behemoth?

00:19:33.821 --> 00:19:37.814
We have no more use for it.
Feel free to use it for yourselves!

00:19:37.992 --> 00:19:38.526
I don't need your stupid...

00:19:38.526 --> 00:19:39.754
You really mean it?!
I don't need your stupid...

00:19:39.861 --> 00:19:43.126
I've always wanted one of these!
Thank you so much!

00:19:43.331 --> 00:19:44.798
What're you gonna do
with a spaceship?

00:19:44.899 --> 00:19:48.892
This is goodbye, my friends!
Now, take off for Earth!

00:19:52.673 --> 00:19:54.106
Goodbye!

00:19:54.208 --> 00:19:57.666
This means that the human world
effectively belongs to me, too.

00:19:58.012 --> 00:20:01.743
Way to go, Highness! Is that what you
were after when you agreed to that treaty?

00:20:01.849 --> 00:20:03.407
You sly devil, you!

00:20:03.518 --> 00:20:05.213
Don't go overboard
with the compliments.

00:20:08.289 --> 00:20:10.086
I'm leaving, too.
For Celestia.

00:20:10.191 --> 00:20:11.886
Huh? How come?

00:20:12.226 --> 00:20:14.456
Something is happening
in Celestia.

00:20:14.796 --> 00:20:17.264
That's the only conclusion
that I can come to.

00:20:17.432 --> 00:20:21.869
I think I'll be able to find some answers
if I go to see Seraph Lamington.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:27.639
Laharl, Etna, I really appreciate
everything that you've done for me.

00:20:27.909 --> 00:20:29.740
Thank you
very much.

00:20:30.178 --> 00:20:31.304
Flonne?

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.375
Take care, you two.

00:20:36.017 --> 00:20:39.214
Are you sure you want
to let Flonne go all by herself?

00:20:41.189 --> 00:20:43.657
Hold it!
I'm coming, too.

00:20:44.459 --> 00:20:46.552
I knew it, you were
worried about her!

00:20:46.761 --> 00:20:48.092
You stinker!

00:20:48.262 --> 00:20:49.229
As if!

00:20:49.664 --> 00:20:51.962
This is the perfect opportunity
for me to take over Celestia!

00:20:52.767 --> 00:20:54.962
- To take over Celestia?!
- To take over Celestia?!

00:20:55.503 --> 00:20:57.300
I've taken control
of the Netherworld.

00:20:57.438 --> 00:21:00.339
For all intents and purposes, the human
world now belongs to me, too.

00:21:00.908 --> 00:21:03.342
All that's left is Celestia, and thanks
to what happened today,

00:21:03.444 --> 00:21:06.379
...I now have the means to invade THEM
fair and square!

00:21:06.814 --> 00:21:10.409
It's only a matter of time before Celestia
falls into my clutches, too!

00:21:12.019 --> 00:21:13.748
What a Prince-ish
thing to say. Right?

00:21:14.856 --> 00:21:17.051
It sure is.
That's Laharl all over.

00:21:17.191 --> 00:21:21.218
Hey! How come I'm the one who has
to pilot this stupid thing?!

00:21:21.395 --> 00:21:23.022
Are we ready to
set sail, everyone?

00:21:23.231 --> 00:21:26.598
All right, set course for Celestia!
Take off!

00:21:40.681 --> 00:21:44.014
If I don't do something,
they'll ruin all my plans...

00:21:50.024 --> 00:21:52.151
You have done enough.

00:21:53.394 --> 00:21:55.362
Seraph Lamington!

00:21:56.297 --> 00:21:58.697
You have served me well,
Vulcanus.

00:22:08.276 --> 00:22:11.404
Ow... We're there already?

00:22:11.679 --> 00:22:13.203
No, we're not.

00:22:16.517 --> 00:22:18.348
A red moon?

00:22:41.008 --> 00:22:48.437
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:48.783 --> 00:22:56.519
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:56.824 --> 00:23:04.663
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:04.765 --> 00:23:11.728
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:12.406 --> 00:23:20.177
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:20.281 --> 00:23:27.983
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:28.089 --> 00:23:39.830
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:39.934 --> 00:23:43.927
...hikari to kage
wa kurikaesu.

00:23:44.839 --> 00:23:49.139
Chain react.

00:23:56.584 --> 00:24:00.281
The next episode of Disgaea
is chock full of love, Highness!

00:24:00.388 --> 00:24:01.912
Stop it, you're
grossing me out.

00:24:02.023 --> 00:24:05.515
It's inevitable that hot tears of profound
emotion will crawl down your cheek!

00:24:05.626 --> 00:24:06.650
Humph! You wish.

00:24:06.761 --> 00:24:09.491
You'd better have your hankies
at the ready, everybody!

00:24:09.597 --> 00:24:12.964
See, what did I tell you? Flonne's already
turned on the waterworks!

00:24:13.067 --> 00:24:16.161
Yikes, seeing her face without
any makeup scares even ME...

00:24:16.504 --> 00:24:20.041
Next time on Disgaea!
"A Night Lit Up By a Red Moon"!

00:24:20.041 --> 00:24:21.108
Next Time:
A Night Lit Up By a Red Moon
Next time on Disgaea!
"A Night Lit Up By a Red Moon"!

00:24:21.108 --> 00:24:23.644
Next Time:
A Night Lit Up By a Red Moon
I'll never admit to love being
anything but worthless. Never!

00:24:23.644 --> 00:24:24.941
Next Time:
A Night Lit Up By a Red Moon
